{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Ingaggio 是一款專為按件計酬的自由工作者而設的工作與收入管理工具，攝影師、影片製作、技師、設計師與顧問等接單工作者都合用。它會自動結算每份工作的報價、訂金與尾款，並整理出誰仍未付款、每年收入走勢及個別客戶表現，所有資料只存放在手機之中，無廣告、無訂閱。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>誰仍未付款一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>只需數秒即可記錄一項工作，總額、訂金與應付尾款會自動計算。統計頁可比較最多四年的逐月收入、列出未付款客戶名單，並顯示單一客戶的往績圖表與最佳月份、平均工作價值等數字。你亦可為工作附加相片與 PDF、設定待辦提醒，並匯出試算表或完整備份。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-25-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-26-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-27-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-28-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-29-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-30-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Ingaggio: Lavori e Incassi</li>\n<li>應用類別：Business</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T15:00:01.845346+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}